ael kings 1Sam 8:15 (predict.), 1Kin 22:9 2Chr 18:8 ; 2Kin 8:6 ; 9:32 (all of Northern Israel); 1Chr 28:1 (in David's time). 2Kin 23:11 ; 24:12 , 15 compare Jer 29:2 , also 34:19 ; 38:7 ; 41:16 (all in Judah; so likewise) 2Kin 25:19 (military officer) = Jer 52:25 ; of Babylonian kings 2Kin 20:18 = Isa 39:7 (predict.); ascribed to Nebuchadnezzar in Daniel, סָרִיסָיו רַב Dan 1:3 , הַסָּרִיסִים שַׂר 1:7 ; 1:8 ; 1:9 ; 1:10 ; 1:11 ; 1:18 ; to king of Persia in Est 1:10 , 12 , 15 9 t. Esther; promises made to eunuchs Isa 56:3-4 ,. (Term never used in law codes; on contrary compare exclusion of דַּכָּא מְּצוּעַ , and שָׁפְכָה כְּרוּת Deut 23:2 [see Dr on the passage ], also אָ֑שֶׁךְ מְרוֺחַ Lev 21:20 .) &#8212; רַבסָֿרִיס is title of high military officer 2Kin 18:17 (Assyrian ), Jer 39:3 , 13 (Babylonian ). — See further, Thes Smith DB Art. ' Eunuch, ' Di Gen 39:1 Dr Deut 23:1 .","rootNote":"or סָרִס ; from an unused root meaning to castrate ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 28 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 28 1","1Kgs 22 9","1Sam 8 15","2Chr 18 8","2Kgs 8 6","2Kgs 9 32","2Kgs 20 18","2Kgs 23 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":42,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 28 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סָּרִיסִ֧ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 22 9","book":"1Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סָרִ֖יס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 8 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":8,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/סָרִיסָ֖י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 18 8","book":"2Chr","chapter":18,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סָרִ֖יס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 8 6","book":"2Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סָרִ֨יס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"